Description:The opponent controls Containment Priest. You control a Mountain and two Plains and have Soul Summons and Shock in hand; your library is all Forests. End the turn with the top card of your library manifested as a face-down creature on your battlefield (one card fewer in your library) and none of your cards in exile.
Rule:rulesguru-19214282e3c5da5c | A manifested card is turned face down before it moves, so it enters as a nontoken 2/2 creature that was not cast (CR 701.40a, 708.2): Containment Priest exiles it even when the card is a land, so the Priest must die first
